d interior evidence; food safety remains separately unresolved.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a bounded opening and interior-inspection capability, then assess its prerequisites and costs before learning or execution.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The exterior examination established previously unrecorded visible features and clarified why nondestructive viewing cannot reveal the interior. No food or preparation benefit has been demonstrated.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

